      "title": "Administrative Assistant and Admissions Counselor",
      "description": "The full-time Administrative Assistant & Admission Counselor will: provide clerical and administrative support to the Program Director and all Program Faculty; in conjunction with the Program Admissions Committee Chair, coordinate the admissions process for the program including all records, admissions cycle updates, and offers; maintain all social media platforms for the program; assist the Program Director in managing the operating budget, while processing orders and monitoring inventory needs; keep all records and data related to the application and admission to the program and the didactic curriculum as needed for accreditation; and work with faculty and university staff to ensure that the daily and ongoing accreditation needs of the program are met effectively.  Additionally, this position will work independently to improve existing program processes. ",
